{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]噢，你们回来了！[l]——怎么样，小工匠，结晶带回来了吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1","y":20,"d":0.8,"x":0},"key":"shake"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","trans":true,"scaleX":0.9,"noOut":false,"y":-92,"x":50,"scaleY":0.9,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"addImg":""},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","trans":true,"scaleX":0.9,"noOut":false,"y":-92,"x":50,"scaleY":0.9,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]咳咳……","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1","y":0,"d":0.8,"x":20},"key":"shake"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]呸呸……鼻子嘴里都是土，好难受……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","trans":true,"scaleX":0.9,"noOut":false,"y":-92,"x":50,"scaleY":0.9,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]原来如此。这般，这般……哦？这就成了？嘶，肉眼看不太出来，[r]但是你的伙伴们会有潜力增幅的感觉？这也太玄乎了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","trans":true,"scaleX":0.9,"noOut":false,"y":-92,"x":50,"scaleY":0.9,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]什么玄乎啊，这些结晶也是我们拼着性命危险采集的，有必要骗你嘛！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","trans":true,"scaleX":0.9,"noOut":false,"y":-92,"x":50,"scaleY":0.9,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]不不，我可没怀疑你们。我们同样是匠人，不会拿这种事开玩笑。[r][l]但我们打铁的，要的就是一个所见即所得，你这套功夫我可挺难理解。[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","trans":true,"scaleX":0.9,"noOut":false,"y":-92,"x":50,"scaleY":0.9,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]唉？你的意思是——[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","trans":true,"scaleX":0.9,"noOut":false,"y":-92,"x":50,"scaleY":0.9,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]哈哈哈，我不是说了嘛。我就是想开开眼界，[r][l]顺便想借鉴一下这门小工匠的独家技术有无可学之处，这也是一种交流。[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]但目前看来，小工匠的这手绝活，我还真学不来，这可真打击人。[r][l]好啦，不浪费时间了。你们帮这座工房清理了魔物，我们非常感激，把这些也带上吧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","trans":true,"scaleX":0.9,"noOut":false,"y":-92,"x":50,"scaleY":0.9,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]唉？这些是……？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","trans":true,"scaleX":0.9,"noOut":false,"y":-92,"x":50,"scaleY":0.9,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]之前我们采集回来，却完全没办法用上的结晶矿。[r][l]虽然数量不算多，但既然只有你们能妥善利用，不如都送给你们。[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"掌炉者库尔斯","text":"[show]……拜托了，契约者。替我们变强，干掉那些可恶的魔物……[r][l]让我们终有一天，能重建我们自己的家园。[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":1,"img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","trans":true,"scaleX":0.9,"noOut":false,"y":-92,"x":50,"scaleY":0.9,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]……谢谢您，库尔斯先生。我们会加油的。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"transTime":300,"alpha":0,"img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","trans":true,"scaleX":0.9,"noOut":false,"y":-92,"x":50,"scaleY":0.9,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"addImg":""},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"script":"sub_0_11_3_y","des":"挖掘结晶_y"}